{"lang":"en","summary":"第一本面向 1.6T 稀疏 MoE 模型源码的深度专著。","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">created</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 2026<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>07<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>14 21<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">37</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">updated</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 2026<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>07<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>14 21<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">37</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">aliases</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> DeepSeek V4 源码剖析\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DeepSeek V4 源码剖析\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">source</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> https<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>//www.yangyitao.com/books/deepseek<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>v4\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> ai<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>models\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> DeepSeek\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> 系列教程\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> index\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> AI\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">category</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> AI模型/DeepSeek\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">cssclasses</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> ai<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>models\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> series\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> index\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">note</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">series</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DeepSeek V4 源码剖析</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout=\"info\" class=\"callout drop-shadow\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-info\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">文档定位</div></div><div class=\"callout-content ab-note\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AI 整理 + 学习笔记</strong>。原文出自杨艺韬《DeepSeek V4 源码剖析》一书。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">原文链接:<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.yangyitao.com/books/deepseek-v4\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yangyitao.com/books/deepseek-v4</a><br>\n系列入口:<a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/README/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/README/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">大模型/DeepSeek V4 源码剖析/README</a></p>\n</div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第一本面向 1.6T 稀疏 MoE 模型源码的深度专著。</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">本书基于 <strong>DeepSeek-V4-Pro Preview</strong>（2026-04-24 在 Hugging Face 开源，MIT 许可）的官方推理实现 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">inference/model.py</code>、<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">config.json</code>、官方 <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro/blob/main/DeepSeek_V4.pdf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro/blob/main/DeepSeek_V4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">DeepSeek_V4.pdf 技术报告</a> ，以及与之配套发布的三个工程仓库——<a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/FlashMLA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/FlashMLA\" target=\"_blank\">FlashMLA</a> （稀疏注意力 CUDA 内核）、<a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM\" target=\"_blank\">DeepGEMM</a> （FP4/FP8 GEMM 内核）、<a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepEP\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepEP\" target=\"_blank\">DeepEP</a> （MoE all-to-all 通信库），系统拆解 V4 在架构、精度、训练、部署四个维度上的全部设计决策。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"这本书会回答你什么\" dir=\"auto\">这本书会回答你什么</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">为什么 V4 把传统残差换成了 <strong>Hyper-Connections</strong>（hc_mult=4）？数学结构如何在 BF16 与 FP32 之间稳定切换？</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">1M token 上下文，是怎么把 <strong>KV cache 压到 V3.2 的 10%、推理 FLOPs 压到 27%</strong>的？<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">Compressor</code>+ <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">Indexer</code>+ <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">sparse_attn</code>三件套各承担什么角色？</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">384 个 routed expert + 1 个 shared expert，<strong>top-6 激活</strong>，前 3 层为什么是 <strong>hash 路由</strong>而不是学习路由？sqrtsoftplus 比 softmax / sigmoid 强在哪里？</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>FP4 e2m1 (experts) + FP8 e4m3 (linear) + ue8m0 scale + 块大小 128×128</strong>的混合精度方案，到底是怎么在 1.6T 参数上保住数值稳定性的？</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Muon 优化器</strong>取代 AdamW 的关键差异是什么？32T tokens 预训练 + 两阶段后训练（领域 SFT/RL → on-policy 蒸馏）的 pipeline 怎么走？</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">V4 怎样在 vLLM / SGLang / FlashMLA 这些下游引擎里被\"激活\"——从 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">DeepseekV4ForCausalLM</code>配置到 PagedAttention + 稀疏 kernel 的对接路径。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"目录\" dir=\"auto\">目录</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"开篇\" dir=\"auto\">开篇</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"前言-1.6-万亿参数的工程美学\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E5%89%8D%E8%A8%80-1.6-%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BF%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%A6/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E5%89%8D%E8%A8%80-1.6-%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BF%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%A6/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">前言：1.6 万亿参数的工程美学</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"第一篇：全景\" dir=\"auto\">第一篇：全景</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第1章-V4-之路-从-V2-V3-V3.2-到-V4-的架构演进\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC1%E7%AB%A0-V4-%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF-%E4%BB%8E-V2-V3-V3.2-%E5%88%B0-V4-%E7%9A%84%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%BC%94%E8%BF%9B/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC1%E7%AB%A0-V4-%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF-%E4%BB%8E-V2-V3-V3.2-%E5%88%B0-V4-%E7%9A%84%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%BC%94%E8%BF%9B/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第1章 V4 之路：从 V2 / V3 / V3.2 到 V4 的架构演进</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"第二篇：注意力革命\" dir=\"auto\">第二篇：注意力革命</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第2章-MLA-进阶-head_dim-512-与-grouped-O-投影\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC2%E7%AB%A0-MLA-%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6-head_dim-512-%E4%B8%8E-grouped-O-%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC2%E7%AB%A0-MLA-%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6-head_dim-512-%E4%B8%8E-grouped-O-%E6%8A%95%E5%BD%B1/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第2章 MLA 进阶：head_dim 512 与 grouped O 投影</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第3章-Compressor-滑窗与-KV-几何压缩\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC3%E7%AB%A0-Compressor-%E6%BB%91%E7%AA%97%E4%B8%8E-KV-%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC3%E7%AB%A0-Compressor-%E6%BB%91%E7%AA%97%E4%B8%8E-KV-%E5%87%A0%E4%BD%95%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第3章 Compressor：滑窗与 KV 几何压缩</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第4章-Indexer-稀疏注意力的可学路由\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC4%E7%AB%A0-Indexer-%E7%A8%80%E7%96%8F%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E5%AD%A6%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC4%E7%AB%A0-Indexer-%E7%A8%80%E7%96%8F%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%AF%E5%AD%A6%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第4章 Indexer：稀疏注意力的可学路由</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第5章-sparse_attn-与-FlashMLA-V4-路径下的-CUDA-内核\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC5%E7%AB%A0-sparse_attn-%E4%B8%8E-FlashMLA-V4-%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84-CUDA-%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC5%E7%AB%A0-sparse_attn-%E4%B8%8E-FlashMLA-V4-%E8%B7%AF%E5%BE%84%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84-CUDA-%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第5章 sparse_attn 与 FlashMLA：V4 路径下的 CUDA 内核</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第6章-YaRN-RoPE-与-1M-长上下文工程\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC6%E7%AB%A0-YaRN-RoPE-%E4%B8%8E-1M-%E9%95%BF%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC6%E7%AB%A0-YaRN-RoPE-%E4%B8%8E-1M-%E9%95%BF%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第6章 YaRN RoPE 与 1M 长上下文工程</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"第三篇：MoE 引擎\" dir=\"auto\">第三篇：MoE 引擎</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第7章-Gate-之变-sqrtsoftplus-noaux_tc-与-routed_scaling\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC7%E7%AB%A0-Gate-%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%98-sqrtsoftplus-noaux_tc-%E4%B8%8E-routed_scaling/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC7%E7%AB%A0-Gate-%E4%B9%8B%E5%8F%98-sqrtsoftplus-noaux_tc-%E4%B8%8E-routed_scaling/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第7章 Gate 之变：sqrtsoftplus、noaux_tc 与 routed_scaling</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第8章-384-专家与-Hash-路由-前-3-层为什么不学\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC8%E7%AB%A0-384-%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%8E-Hash-%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1-%E5%89%8D-3-%E5%B1%82%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%A6/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC8%E7%AB%A0-384-%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%8E-Hash-%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1-%E5%89%8D-3-%E5%B1%82%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%B8%8D%E5%AD%A6/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第8章 384 专家与 Hash 路由：前 3 层为什么不学</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第9章-Expert-与共享专家-SwiGLU-clip-容量平衡\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC9%E7%AB%A0-Expert-%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6-SwiGLU-clip-%E5%AE%B9%E9%87%8F%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC9%E7%AB%A0-Expert-%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6-SwiGLU-clip-%E5%AE%B9%E9%87%8F%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第9章 Expert 与共享专家：SwiGLU + clip + 容量平衡</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"第四篇：超连接与 MTP\" dir=\"auto\">第四篇：超连接与 MTP</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第10章-Hyper-Connections-替代残差的-hc_mult-通路\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC10%E7%AB%A0-Hyper-Connections-%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E6%AE%8B%E5%B7%AE%E7%9A%84-hc_mult-%E9%80%9A%E8%B7%AF/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/DeepSeek%20V4%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC10%E7%AB%A0-Hyper-Connections-%E6%9B%BF%E4%BB%A3%E6%AE%8B%E5%B7%AE%E7%9A%84-hc_mult-%E9%80%9A%E8%B7%AF/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第10章 Hyper-Connections：替代残差的 hc_mult 通路</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第11章-MTP-多-Token-预测的训练放大器\